# # /ythril/
#
# Permanent identifiers of the Ythril project, an open-source knowledge graph
# server: https://github.com/ythril-network/Ythril
#
# https://w3id.org/ythril/ns is the namespace of the Ythril vocabulary, the
# terms Ythril's RDF export defines itself (prefix ythril:, terms written
# https://w3id.org/ythril/ns#Term). A request for Turtle is redirected to the
# vocabulary file, any other request to its documentation page.
#
# https://w3id.org/ythril/ redirects to the project.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by the Ythril project:
#
# GitHub organisation: ythril-network
# GitHub username: MetalMMagic

RewriteEngine on

# The vocabulary namespace, as Turtle
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle
RewriteRule ^ns$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ythril-network/Ythril/main/docs/rdf/ythril.ttl [R=303,L]

# The vocabulary namespace, for everything else: the documentation page
RewriteRule ^ns$ https://github.com/ythril-network/Ythril/blob/main/docs/rdf/ythril-vocabulary.md [R=303,L]

# The identifier itself: the project
RewriteRule ^$ https://github.com/ythril-network/Ythril [R=302,L]
